  "translation": "Today is Sunday. Our whole family goes to a restaurant for lunch. We walk from home to the restaurant. That restaurant is in front of our home. We arrive at the restaurant, and there are many people inside. We find a table and sit down. The waiter gives us the menu, and we ask what's delicious. I can order a cup of milk tea. My younger brother also orders a bowl of noodles. Dad and mom order dumplings and fish. We all eat a lot. I don't like to eat fish. After eating, we go home."
